    "description": "The Event Ticketing History Retrieval API allows users to access a comprehensive history of ticket purchases associated with various events. This endpoint provides vital insights into past transactions, enabling event organizers and ticket sellers to analyze customer behaviors and trends. Typical users include event management teams, analytics departments, and customer service representatives who need to track ticket sales and customer engagement over time. By leveraging this API, businesses can enhance their understanding of ticketing patterns and improve future event offerings.",
